<title>USA: ICG to announce details on contract.</title>
<headline>ICG to announce details on contract.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>ICG Communications said it will announce at a news conference on Tuesday a $1 billion contract that will allow it to &quot;significantly and rapidly expand its local exchange telecommunications operations.&quot;</p>
<p>An ICG spokesman declined to identify the company other than to say it is publicly traded.</p>
